     "answer": "|adj A| = 4 and |adj(adj A)| = 16.",
     "why": "|adj A| = |A|^(n-1) = 2^2 = 4, and applying the same rule twice gives |adj(adj A)| = |A|^((n-1)^2) = 2^4."
